{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "Service-auth Ed25519 dual-control rollout dashboard. Operator uses this to time the Phase 1 → Phase 2 cutover per ADR 2026-05-13-service-auth-ed25519-adoption Q3. The LoopRuntimeServiceAuthSignaturePhase1Ready stat lights up when the 7-day soak at 100% present rate is satisfied.",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Phase 1 Ready (7d 100% present)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(loop_runtime_service_auth_signature_phase1_ready)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "value": "0", "text": "NOT READY" },
            { "type": "value", "value": "1", "text": "READY — flip Phase 2" }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Last-1h signature adoption rate",
      "gridPos": { "x": 6, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(loop_runtime_service_auth_signature_adoption_1h) * 100",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 80 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 95 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 99.5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Signed vs unsigned traffic (cutover progress)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loop_runtime_service_auth_signature_present_total{outcome=\"present\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "signed",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loop_runtime_service_auth_signature_present_total{outcome=\"absent\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "unsigned",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 25,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Phase 2 flag (operator-controlled)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(loop_runtime_service_auth_signature_rejected_total{reason=\"signature_missing\"}) > bool 0",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "value": "0", "text": "Phase 1 (accept-both)" },
            { "type": "value", "value": "1", "text": "Phase 2 (require-signed)" }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "yellow", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active rejections (5m, all reasons)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 6, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loop_runtime_service_auth_signature_rejected_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.01 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Signature rejection reasons (forensic breakdown)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 8, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(loop_runtime_service_auth_signature_rejected_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{ reason }}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "values": ["last", "max"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Rejection reasons (last 1h)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 8, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(loop_runtime_service_auth_signature_rejected_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{ reason }}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Operator decision tree",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 16, "w": 24, "h": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cutover protocol (per ADR Q3)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 17, "w": 24, "h": 10 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Phase 1 → Phase 2 cutover (operator decision tree)\n\n1. **Watch panel 1 (Phase 1 Ready stat).** Wait until it lights GREEN — 7 consecutive days at 100% present rate over the trailing window.\n2. **Confirm panel 4 still says Phase 1 (accept-both).** The flag is operator-controlled via env var `LOOP_RUNTIME_SERVICE_AUTH_REQUIRE_SIGNATURE=true`.\n3. **Verify panel 5 shows 0 active rejections.** If non-zero, panel 6 breakdown identifies the cause — do NOT flip Phase 2 until panel 6 is clean.\n4. **Flip Phase 2:** `kubectl set env deploy/loop-runtime-api -n loop-runtime-system LOOP_RUNTIME_SERVICE_AUTH_REQUIRE_SIGNATURE=true` then `kubectl rollout restart deploy/loop-runtime-api -n loop-runtime-system && kubectl rollout status deploy/loop-runtime-api -n loop-runtime-system`.\n5. **7-day Phase 2 soak.** Watch panel 6 for `reason=\"signature_missing\"` — indicates a caller that never adopted the signer (forgotten replica, third-party probe). Each non-zero reading is an operator action item.\n6. **Phase 3 marker:** once Phase 2 has soaked 7 days with `signature_missing` rate at 0, the dual-control is steady-state. No further toggles.\n\n## Rollback (per ADR Reversibility)\n\nIf panel 5 shows sustained rejections in Phase 2 from a legitimate caller:\n\n```\nkubectl set env deploy/loop-runtime-api -n loop-runtime-system LOOP_RUNTIME_SERVICE_AUTH_REQUIRE_SIGNATURE=false\nkubectl rollout restart deploy/loop-runtime-api -n loop-runtime-system\n```\n\nThis reverts to Phase 1 accept-both within ~30s. The Ed25519 verification still happens for signed requests; only the require-signed gate is dropped."
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "tags": ["loop-runtime", "service-auth", "ed25519", "security", "audit-M10-G1"],
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "title": "Service-Auth Ed25519 Rollout",
  "uid": "loop-runtime-service-auth-ed25519",
  "version": 1
}
